[[63,7,1024,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Press the lever and fold down the rear seat.</p><p>2. Undo the fixing bolt (2a), saving the spacers, and withdraw the seat belt (2b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003510.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,1024,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Fit the seat belt in its seating.</p><p>2. Tighten the fixing bolt to torque (2a), fitting the plastic spacers (2b) and washers (2c), as shown in the figure.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000656.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CENTRE REAR BELT.</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>4</p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Fit the retaining washer.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003511.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,1024,"<p>Reposition the rear seat.</p>"]]